# App Identity

## What This App Is
A **web app for a local synagogue**, targeted at its members. The name *Anusim* (ענוסים) refers to forced converts / crypto-Jews.

## Language
**The entire app is in Portuguese (PT-BR).** This includes:
- All UI text, labels, buttons, placeholders, error messages, and headings
- All user-facing strings — never write English copy in components
- Code itself (variables, functions, comments) stays in English

```tsx
// ❌ BAD
<button>Submit</button>
<p>Loading...</p>

// ✅ GOOD
<button>Enviar</button>
<p>Carregando...</p>
```

## Core Features
These are the planned features — always keep them in mind when designing new components or data models:

| Feature | Description |
|---|---|
| **Calendário de Eventos** | Synagogue event calendar with Jewish holidays |
| **Zmanim** | Daily Jewish prayer times based on location |
| **Doações** | Member donation tracking and contribution management |
| **Estudo** | Torah study materials, parasha of the week, learning resources |

## Authentication
- Members log in with accounts (via Supabase Auth)
- Role model: `member` (base) and `admin` (synagogue staff)
- Protected routes require authentication — redirect unauthenticated users to `/login`
- Public pages (e.g. landing, about) are accessible without login

## Domain Vocabulary (PT)
Use consistent Portuguese terms throughout the app:

| Concept | PT term to use |
|---|---|
| Synagogue | Sinagoga |
| Member | Membro |
| Prayer times | Horários de oração / Zmanim |
| Donation | Doação |
| Event | Evento |
| Torah portion | Parashá |
| Jewish calendar | Calendário judaico |
| Login | Entrar |
| Register | Cadastrar-se |
